                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Improve this model&apos;s Leadership and Objective Control characteristics by 1 and, if this model is your **^^Warlord^^** and it passes its Plots and Schemes test after the battle, it gains 1 additional Lore point.</characteristic>
