                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model&apos;s unit is selected to fight, select one of the following abilities: **[LETHAL HITS]**; **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**. Until the end of the phase, this model&apos;s melee weapons have the selected ability.</characteristic>
