                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="4e3c-58dd-9e6e-e1f4">Select one **^^Area Terrain^^** feature within 24&quot; of and visible to the manifesting model, then roll one D6 for every enemy model that is within that **^^Area Terrain^^** feature; for each 6, that model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If the Psychic test result for this Ritual was 11+, for each 5+, that model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound instead (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds in either case).</characteristic>
